                        "sense_id": "ae1ca446-4322-384d-8599-6763ab37c268",
                        "entry_id": "28c3e247-1e1c-34cc-8c8f-88b77acc3b3d",
                        "glosses": [
                            "in a hurry, hurriedly, helter-skelter, hastily"
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "colloquial"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "b1882fa7-f4bf-42fa-84e5-7594ad602052",
                                "sense_id": "ae1ca446-4322-384d-8599-6763ab37c268",
                                "text": "А́ннинька вороти́лась к дя́де ску́чная, ти́хая. Впро́чем, э́то не меша́ло ей чу́вствовать себя́ не́сколько голо́дною (дя́денька, впопыха́х, да́же ку́рочки с ней не отпусти́л), и она́ была́ о́чень ра́да, что стол для ча́я был уж накры́т.",
                                "translation": "Anninka returned to her uncle’s house listless and quiet. However, this did not stop her feeling somewhat hungry (in the rush Uncle had failed even to supply a chicken for the journey) and she was very pleased to find the table ready laid for tea.",
                                "english": "Anninka returned to her uncle’s house listless and quiet. However, this did not stop her feeling somewhat hungry (in the rush Uncle had failed even to supply a chicken for the journey) and she was very pleased to find the table ready laid for tea."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
